{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aEndless Loop\u300b is a deck-building tactics roguelike game that combines the gameplay of \u300aSlay the Spire\u300b and \u300aInto the Breach\u300b. Featuring the loop mechanism of &quot;energy is life&quot;, you need to maneuver your troops, strike a balance between restoring life and consuming energy, and defeat all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959840/extras/678cca3cd65f7bd7850fec74c7172f9e.avif?t=1756009298\" width=601 height=171 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Life</strong> Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy is life. Consume life to use cards, minions take damage, restore life, and test the depth of your strategy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959840/extras/4fc7f3feb51897a23471232168cb66f7.poster.avif?t=1756009298\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959840/extras/4fc7f3feb51897a23471232168cb66f7.webm?t=1756009298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959840/extras/4fc7f3feb51897a23471232168cb66f7.mp4?t=1756009298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959840/extras/9d1f2cad19d6c326ea2ef838be004ece.avif?t=1756009298\" width=601 height=171 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle Mode &amp; Adventure Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Mode: Continuous battles, quick deck building, head-to-head combat, and fast-paced, exhilarating battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Mode: Choose different routes, face enemies, shops, rest areas, treasures, and events, gradually build your deck, and continuously defeat enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959840/extras/9eb7899de37e70c1c5ccc1e2c700d25b.poster.avif?t=1756009298\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959840/extras/9eb7899de37e70c1c5ccc1e2c700d25b.webm?t=1756009298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959840/extras/9eb7899de37e70c1c5ccc1e2c700d25b.mp4?t=1756009298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959840/extras/e0165723a9afc86d1db0232039119072.avif?t=1756009298\" width=601 height=171 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rune Embedding &amp; Blessing Enhancement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embed runes into cards to obtain blessings, deeply construct attack, defense, and card flow, and comprehensively enhance combat power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959840/extras/dcefadaf0d9399a8b05eca63a77bf3df.poster.avif?t=1756009298\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959840/extras/dcefadaf0d9399a8b05eca63a77bf3df.webm?t=175